From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Matthew Schwartz <matthew.schwartz@linux.dev>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 00:11:11 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] HACK: scripts: use the software backlight on the ASUS ROG
 Xbox Ally X20

This is definitely not going to be feasible to keep up, but alas...
add another one to the software backlight list.
